  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan names Earth Tunnel among the ten earths, the unique terrains the world called by that name after the five regions became one, the two heavens combined, and the earth veins of the five regions merged. The other nine are Earth Abyss, Earth Trench, Earth Cave, Earth Prison, Production Earth, Flying Earth, Formation Earth, Earth Treasury, and Tomb Earth.",
      "chapters": [
        2058
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "reg_earth_earth_abyss",
        "reg_earth_earth_trench",
        "reg_earth_earth_cave",
        "gu_earth_prison",
        "reg_earth_production_earth",
        "reg_earth_flying_earth",
        "reg_earth_formation_earth",
        "reg_earth_earth_treasury",
        "reg_earth_tomb_earth"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Southern Border’s Paradise Earth true inheritance describes the ten earths in detail and states that they can bear the task of being earth vein nodes. Earth Tunnel is one of the five Fang Yuan can create while he builds an artificial earth vein, with the four others being Earth Abyss, Earth Trench, Production Earth and Formation Earth.",
      "chapters": [
        2142
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "earth-vein-node",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "inh_paradise_earth_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside a dream realm, Meng Qiu Zhen searches Tu clan village’s real underground prison, a maze of thousands of intersecting paths dug through a whole mountain, and finds traces of Earth Tunnel there. He judges the mountain to be of famous mountain level and to hold a natural Earth Tunnel, and says Tu clan village developed that tunnel only slightly and still gained a large amount of resources, which is why it could nurture two rank four elders. He hears Gu cultivators travelling through the Earth Tunnel ahead of him and watches the village’s two rank four elders slip out of it.",
      "chapters": [
        2145
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
